// INSOLVENCY vertical — given a company number, Orbital routes it into the real UK
// distress corpus (Gazette insolvency notices + Companies House + PSC ownership +
// G-Cloud / DOS government awards) and returns a distress profile: in-distress flag,
// severity, plain-English stage, the latest insolvency event + date, a serial-failure
// controller note, and any live government contracts that could re-compete.
//
// Backed by demo/services/insolvency_service.py on :8901 (read-only over the corpus).
// The join key is uk.gov.CompanyRegistrationNumber, so this composes with the rest of
// the brain: type a company NAME, GLEIF/Companies House emit the number, and Orbital
// plans straight through to this distress lens — no integration declared anywhere.
//
//   07021926 = AASEYA SOFTWARE SERVICES (UK) LIMITED (winding-up petition, distressed)
//   08810995 = CAVENDISH WOOD LIMITED               (liquidator appointed, severity 5)
//   09446231 = MONZO BANK LIMITED                   (healthy control — inDistress:false)
given { id : uk.gov.CompanyRegistrationNumber = "07021926" }
find { brain.insolvency.InsolvencyProfile }
